WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:55.950
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:56.220 --> 00:58.486
[Conversation with his dad.]

3
00:59.170 --> 01:02.200
(Happy birthday!)

4
01:09.100 --> 01:10.533
Oh, Dad.

5
01:11.633 --> 01:13.233
You got off easy

6
01:13.633 --> 01:16.300
and left him a mess of a jigsaw puzzle.

7
01:42.866 --> 01:43.866
Hey.

8
01:45.433 --> 01:46.633
Why'd you come out here?

9
01:47.166 --> 01:48.200
Watch your step!

10
01:49.033 --> 01:50.033
I'm fine.

11
01:53.333 --> 01:54.333
This way.

12
02:37.500 --> 02:38.800
Give me one.

13
02:39.400 --> 02:40.599
You smoke too?

14
02:40.600 --> 02:41.900
I used to

15
02:42.900 --> 02:44.300
but I never got hooked.

16
02:45.666 --> 02:47.100
Then you'd better not.

17
02:47.233 --> 02:48.866
You might get hooked this time.

18
02:57.700 --> 02:59.166
Why not come back inside?

19
03:00.700 --> 03:01.700
Avoiding me?

20
03:04.200 --> 03:05.200
I'm not.

21
03:07.033 --> 03:08.766
So something's on your mind?

22
03:12.066 --> 03:13.100
Not really.

23
03:13.900 --> 03:15.333
You're putting on a front.

24
03:15.933 --> 03:16.933
Out with it.

25
03:17.033 --> 03:18.300
Let me hear it too.

26
03:19.733 --> 03:20.733
Wanna hear it?

27
03:21.433 --> 03:22.433
Mm.

28
03:35.733 --> 03:36.733
Go on.

29
03:55.600 --> 03:57.700
There's this

30
03:57.966 --> 03:58.966
friend of mine.

31
04:00.666 --> 04:02.466
When he was twelve

32
04:03.266 --> 04:04.700
his parents got divorced.

33
04:06.533 --> 04:07.733
Then one day

34
04:09.066 --> 04:10.733
his mom brought a man home.

35
04:12.400 --> 04:14.333
He thought his life was over.

36
04:16.000 --> 04:18.132
So he tried everything he could

37
04:18.133 --> 04:19.300
to drive that man out.

38
04:20.233 --> 04:22.333
He even hurt himself to frame him.

39
04:25.333 --> 04:27.333
But that man never exposed him.

40
04:28.866 --> 04:30.133
Later on

41
04:30.433 --> 04:32.366
he spent six months in prison.

42
04:34.066 --> 04:35.400
When he got out

43
04:35.500 --> 04:37.333
he said just one thing to my friend.

44
04:45.933 --> 04:46.933
I'm sorry.

45
04:52.633 --> 04:55.265
That man never abused your friend.

46
04:55.266 --> 04:57.133
So why apologize?

47
04:59.666 --> 05:01.000
I never got it either.

48
05:02.233 --> 05:04.166
But when I grew up I finally understood.

49
05:05.500 --> 05:07.066
That apology

50
05:07.333 --> 05:09.400
maybe it wasn't meant for my friend.

51
05:11.600 --> 05:13.500
He'd abused someone else?

52
05:15.666 --> 05:17.666
Maybe something even worse.

53
05:17.866 --> 05:18.966
Who knows.

54
05:19.233 --> 05:20.700
But after that

55
05:21.100 --> 05:22.766
he never said another word about it.

56
05:25.266 --> 05:26.333
Still

57
05:26.600 --> 05:27.600
he gave all his love

58
05:27.601 --> 05:28.866
to that friend of mine

59
05:30.233 --> 05:31.565
and became the kind of dad

60
05:31.566 --> 05:32.800
every kid at school envied.

61
05:34.700 --> 05:36.665
That friend you're talking about

62
05:36.666 --> 05:38.366
it wouldn't be you, would it?

63
05:41.000 --> 05:42.866
So it was you.

64
05:43.100 --> 05:45.100
I never thought you'd hurt yourself.

65
05:45.333 --> 05:47.232
And a criminal who framed someone.

66
05:47.233 --> 05:48.633
My crimes back then

67
05:49.433 --> 05:50.766
went way beyond that.

68
05:52.233 --> 05:54.033
Then go ahead, tell me...

69
05:54.200 --> 05:55.465
let me hear all the dirt

70
05:55.466 --> 05:57.233
on a lowlife like you.

71
06:19.500 --> 06:20.766
Come on, tell me.

72
06:43.686 --> 06:44.686
Hello?

73
06:44.866 --> 06:45.900
Oh, Yong Qi.

74
06:46.666 --> 06:47.366
What?

75
06:47.533 --> 06:48.833
You're coming to the cabin?

76
06:49.700 --> 06:50.700
You're almost here?

77
06:51.066 --> 06:51.433
Uh.

78
06:51.434 --> 06:52.565
Okay…

79
06:52.566 --> 06:53.566
Okay, okay.

80
06:55.633 --> 06:56.866
Yong Qi's coming?

81
06:57.266 --> 06:58.266
Mm.

82
06:58.400 --> 07:00.000
She said she's bringing me wine.

83
07:00.800 --> 07:02.300
Non-alcoholic wine.

84
07:05.000 --> 07:06.066
You two!

85
07:13.500 --> 07:15.333
Having a barbecue out here

86
07:15.666 --> 07:16.766
and you didn't invite me?

87
07:18.200 --> 07:19.765
We're not having a barbecue!

88
07:19.766 --> 07:21.166
There's no barbecue here.

89
07:21.190 --> 07:21.690
Right.

90
07:22.133 --> 07:23.833
We just came to look around.

91
07:24.300 --> 07:26.000
Then why the big bonfire?

92
07:26.633 --> 07:27.865
Song Yi

93
07:27.866 --> 07:29.132
I've got to say this.

94
07:29.133 --> 07:30.999
He can't drink right now.

95
07:31.000 --> 07:32.366
If you want a drink,

96
07:32.433 --> 07:33.633
just tell me.

97
07:35.600 --> 07:37.199
I've got some

98
07:37.200 --> 07:39.465
non-alcoholic wine.

99
07:39.466 --> 07:40.300
Whoa.

100
07:40.300 --> 07:40.900
Here, take it.

101
07:40.900 --> 07:41.900
Thanks.

102
07:43.010 --> 07:45.809
But we... we really weren't having a barbecue.

103
07:45.833 --> 07:46.633
Look around.

104
07:46.634 --> 07:47.666
There's nothing here.

105
07:48.666 --> 07:50.632
But

106
07:50.633 --> 07:52.066
I've got some!

107
07:52.700 --> 07:53.966
Whoa!

108
07:56.166 --> 07:58.000
That's a huge bag of skewers!

109
07:58.500 --> 08:00.565
You're the best senior ever!

110
08:00.566 --> 08:01.566
Amazing.

111
08:01.900 --> 08:03.000
Really?

112
08:03.533 --> 08:04.865
We really have skewers?

113
08:04.866 --> 08:07.000
Who's the big sister who loves you most?

114
08:07.266 --> 08:09.666
That'd be you, Yong Qi!

115
08:10.133 --> 08:11.799
Come on now, cheers.

116
08:11.800 --> 08:12.733
Here, Feiyu.

117
08:12.800 --> 08:14.933
Cheers!

118
08:21.266 --> 08:21.900
Oof.

119
08:21.900 --> 08:22.900
Okay, okay

120
08:23.133 --> 08:24.165
I'm really done.

121
08:24.166 --> 08:26.833
Now you know what your senior's made of.

122
08:27.666 --> 08:28.999
All right, all right.

123
08:29.000 --> 08:30.000
We've all had enough.

124
08:30.233 --> 08:31.133
Let's head back.

125
08:31.133 --> 08:32.133
Head back?

126
08:32.400 --> 08:34.065
We've both been drinking

127
08:34.066 --> 08:35.066
so who's driving?

128
08:35.213 --> 08:37.980
I came all this way, so we should just stay the night.

129
08:38.233 --> 08:39.699
And I want to hear

130
08:39.700 --> 08:41.900
the orioles singing at dawn.

131
08:43.866 --> 08:44.900
Uh.

132
08:45.833 --> 08:47.565
Let's just head back

133
08:47.566 --> 08:48.766
I'll get us a driver.

134
08:49.100 --> 08:51.132
We're way out here in the mountains,

135
08:51.133 --> 08:52.533
how would you even get one?

136
08:54.909 --> 08:57.565
You mean you can't get one here?

137
08:58.066 --> 08:59.066
Out here…

138
08:59.633 --> 09:01.666
you really can't get a driver.

139
09:04.300 --> 09:06.033
There's only one bed!

140
09:06.286 --> 09:07.286
How are we going to sleep?

141
09:07.366 --> 09:09.833
You think that stumps your big sis?

142
09:09.866 --> 09:12.000
Guess who takes care of this place.

143
09:12.600 --> 09:14.100
So how are we sleeping?

144
09:14.166 --> 09:15.332
This cabin has

145
09:15.333 --> 09:16.800
a top-notch tent.

146
09:17.600 --> 09:19.833
Way too good for you two!

147
09:20.172 --> 09:20.772
So,

148
09:21.066 --> 09:22.300
I'm assigning spots.

149
09:22.533 --> 09:24.265
You two sleep inside

150
09:24.266 --> 09:25.999
I'll pitch a tent outside.

151
09:26.000 --> 09:27.000
How's that gonna work?

152
09:27.166 --> 09:28.332
You're a girl

153
09:28.333 --> 09:29.500
and it's not safe out there.

154
09:30.033 --> 09:31.033
Right.

155
09:31.200 --> 09:32.700
There are wild boars around here.

156
09:32.743 --> 09:33.543
Then...

157
09:33.567 --> 09:34.799
you two take the tent

158
09:34.800 --> 09:35.766
I'll sleep inside.

159
09:35.766 --> 09:36.766
Deal.

160
09:36.800 --> 09:38.333
We'll take one tent each.

161
09:38.633 --> 09:39.966
There's only one tent.

162
09:40.866 --> 09:41.866
What?

163
09:41.970 --> 09:43.702
Then one of you'll sleep with me,

164
09:43.733 --> 09:45.266
I really don't mind.

165
09:47.100 --> 09:47.400
Um…

166
09:47.566 --> 09:48.566
Well…

167
09:54.733 --> 09:55.500
Fine.

168
09:55.500 --> 09:56.200
Come on.

169
09:56.200 --> 09:57.200
Raise your drinks!

170
09:57.666 --> 09:58.666
Bottoms up!

171
10:28.266 --> 10:29.400
Xu Feiyu?

172
10:51.033 --> 10:52.466
You're still not asleep?

173
10:53.333 --> 10:56.200
I'm… sleeping right now…

174
10:58.633 --> 10:59.633
Mm.

175
12:19.033 --> 12:20.033
I'm not cold.

176
12:20.033 --> 12:21.033
Shh.

177
12:21.200 --> 12:22.466
Don't talk.

178
13:07.600 --> 13:08.633
Song Yi.

179
13:09.466 --> 13:10.100
Hm?

180
13:10.300 --> 13:11.300
You

181
13:12.300 --> 13:13.300
you're

182
13:14.066 --> 13:15.800
pressing into me, it's uncomfortable.

183
13:16.500 --> 13:17.500
Oh.

184
13:17.533 --> 13:18.666
Sorry about that.

185
13:20.066 --> 13:21.100
It's fine.

186
13:23.666 --> 13:25.833
You're too far away.

187
13:26.366 --> 13:27.366
I'm cold.

188
13:30.233 --> 13:31.500
Then I'll move closer.

189
13:31.833 --> 13:32.833
Mm.

190
14:04.066 --> 14:05.066
Uh.

191
14:05.666 --> 14:06.800
You're also...

192
14:07.766 --> 14:08.766
Don't talk.

193
14:09.066 --> 14:10.066
Go to sleep.

194
14:14.866 --> 14:17.100
With us pressed together like this

195
14:17.533 --> 14:18.966
there's no way I can sleep.

196
14:20.700 --> 14:22.200
I've got an idea

197
14:22.266 --> 14:24.166
to take your mind off it.

198
14:26.133 --> 14:27.400
What idea?

199
14:29.066 --> 14:31.266
Let me tell you a bedtime story.

200
14:33.466 --> 14:34.466
Go ahead.

201
14:35.766 --> 14:36.500
Hmm?

202
14:36.700 --> 14:39.800
Last month, Yong Qi tried to sleep with a friend of mine.

203
14:42.133 --> 14:43.533
You have friends?

204
14:43.866 --> 14:44.666
Ugh!

205
14:44.866 --> 14:47.266
Quit throwing off my rhythm.

206
14:49.693 --> 14:51.126
So what happened next?

207
14:52.533 --> 14:54.066
So then

208
14:54.233 --> 14:56.566
my friend spent the night in the hospital

209
14:57.333 --> 14:58.499
and Yong Qi

210
14:58.500 --> 15:00.833
got yelled at by my friend's mom all night...
